{"4042730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horde Sweepers", "steam_appid": 4042730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/cf7f243e7b5f73e91a99d1da087ed819.avif?t=1788252120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras_big/cf7f243e7b5f73e91a99d1da087ed819.webp?t=1788252120 width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1170 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.mp4?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/d38b0ddd63c180c00d40d9ebfbb31335.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/4a3350c153c45e723436def623623ef5.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" aria-label=\"Horde Sweepers - Ability\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/4a3350c153c45e723436def623623ef5.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/4a3350c153c45e723436def623623ef5.mp4?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Horde Sweepers</strong> is an ultra-dynamic action <strong>Roguelite</strong> with non-stop gunfire and massive zombie <strong>hordes</strong>. You have an extensive arsenal of firearms at your disposal, ranging from pistols to sniper rifles. A vast list of diverse upgrades opens up immense room for experimentation, completely transforming your gameplay experience. Utilize unique abilities that will make you elusive and deadly to any enemy standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/3d5a5654afc223e07680116cf047b0bd.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/37c31de1f840919e66225b2fbf123f49.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/37c31de1f840919e66225b2fbf123f49.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/37c31de1f840919e66225b2fbf123f49.mp4?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Valerie</strong>, a young but highly skilled marksman, a  <strong>horde sweeper</strong>. She arrives at a new place, remote outpost near an old, abandoned city teeming with monsters. Each day, she ventures into the city, clearing its streets of zombies and mutants, and occasionally chats with the shelter's warden, an old horde sweeper named <strong>Den</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/cac7b3b1b2579c750a223bfaec1e6ecc.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/8e41740963389ef2b3785d85feed99b9.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/8e41740963389ef2b3785d85feed99b9.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/8e41740963389ef2b3785d85feed99b9.mp4?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over a century ago, humanity endured a horrific apocalypse that nearly brought civilization to an end. Yet, with desperate perseverance, scattered tribes of survivors are slowly reclaiming the land. This is where <strong>Horde Sweepers</strong> come in — specialists who exterminate hordes of zombies and other mutants in long-abandoned cities so that one day, people can return here once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge number of upgrades to suit any taste and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse bosses that will challenge you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of firearms, each with its own unique character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities that make the gameplay even more dynamic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/cf7f243e7b5f73e91a99d1da087ed819.avif?t=1788252120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras_big/cf7f243e7b5f73e91a99d1da087ed819.webp?t=1788252120 width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1170 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/aa337f17e161a3923cbdca7e7fe60eeb.mp4?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/d38b0ddd63c180c00d40d9ebfbb31335.avif?t=1788252120\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/4a3350c153c45e723436def623623ef5.poster.avif?t=1788252120\" aria-label=\"Horde Sweepers - Ability\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042730/extras/4a3350c153c45e723436def623623ef5.webm?t=1788252120\" type=\"video/webm; cod